From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zixuan Zhang <zixuan.zhang.uj@renesas.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] video: rzg2l: hand Layer1 over to the CM33 fast logo
 animation

Set up Layer1 before rzg2l_lcdc_start(), because the display lists must
not change while the VSPD runs. Start the animation once the still logo
is on screen, so loading the frames does not delay it.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [RZ/G3L CM33 boot logo animation, board specific]
---
 drivers/video/rzg2l/Makefile      | 1 +
 drivers/video/rzg2l/rzg2l_video.c | 7 +++++++
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/video/rzg2l/Makefile b/drivers/video/rzg2l/Makefile
index e3f3bd33df..9ac37bf4d1 100644
--- a/drivers/video/rzg2l/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/video/rzg2l/Makefile
@@ -4,3 +4,4 @@
 # SJX.
 
 obj-y += rzg2l_video.o
+obj-y += rzg2l_fla.o
diff --git a/drivers/video/rzg2l/rzg2l_video.c b/drivers/video/rzg2l/rzg2l_video.c
index 10b28ff182..9bba373e48 100644
--- a/drivers/video/rzg2l/rzg2l_video.c
+++ b/drivers/video/rzg2l/rzg2l_video.c
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 #include "rzg2l_video.h"
 #include <common.h>
 #include <command.h>
+#include "rzg2l_fla.h"
 
 // PFC
 #define PFC_BASE	0x11030000
@@ -152,6 +153,9 @@ int rzg2l_video_init(void){
 	 */
 	rzg2l_wait_frames(2, 100);
 
+	/* After the still logo is on screen, so the frames do not delay it. */
+	rzg2l_fla_start();
+
 	return 0;
 }
 
@@ -928,6 +932,9 @@ static void rzg2l_vcpd_dl_init(void)
 	header->list[0].pList = (uint32_t)dl_body[2];
 	header->pNext_header = DISPLAY_LIST_HEADER_2;
 	header->flags = 1;
+
+	/* Before rzg2l_lcdc_start(): the display lists must not change while the VSPD runs. */
+	rzg2l_fla_setup(dl_headers[0], dl_headers[1], LCD_HACTIVE, LCD_VACTIVE);
 }
 
 void rzg2l_video_update(void)
-- 
2.53.0

